<title>ISRAEL: First Palestinian bourse opens in West Bank.</title>
<headline>First Palestinian bourse opens in West Bank.</headline>
<dateline>NABLUS, West Bank 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The first Palestinian stock market opened on Tuesday in the West Bank town of Nablus, officials said.</p>
<p>&quot;The market has opened,&quot; Safwan Bataina, general manager of the Palestine Securities Exchange (PSE), told reporters.</p>
